WEBVTT

00:00:13.923 --> 00:00:15.508
They like us?

00:00:15.591 --> 00:00:17.093
Really?

00:00:18.469 --> 00:00:21.055
Excuse me?
Do you know the best way to the airport?

00:00:21.138 --> 00:00:24.934
Yes, fellow Dracula. There's only one way.
Bleh, bleh-bleh.

00:00:25.726 --> 00:00:28.646
But it's all blocked.
We'll never make it in time.

00:00:28.729 --> 00:00:31.482
You should have left an hour earlier.
Bleh, bleh-bleh.

00:00:31.565 --> 00:00:34.193
I do not say "Bleh, bleh-bleh."

00:00:34.819 --> 00:00:37.655
All right, let's just run through it on foot.

00:00:43.619 --> 00:00:45.705
Drac, this'll protect you.

00:00:47.331 --> 00:00:50.084
Imagine if that guy knew
he was talking to the real Drac.

00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:51.877
He'd run for the hills!

00:00:52.253 --> 00:00:54.213
Hold it, now. Hold it, now.

00:00:54.296 --> 00:00:55.631
That sounds spot on.

00:00:55.923 --> 00:01:00.094
But the only way they'd know the real us
is if we show the real us.

00:01:00.177 --> 00:01:01.387
This could work.

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:04.181
You mean, like, scare them?
We haven't scared people in centuries.

00:01:04.265 --> 00:01:06.517
I don't even think I have it in me anymore.

00:01:09.645 --> 00:01:11.230
I got nothing. I really got nothing.

00:01:11.313 --> 00:01:12.940
Let's just move this along.

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:22.491
Fire! Fire!

00:01:22.575 --> 00:01:23.951
Fire!

00:01:37.381 --> 00:01:40.176
I'm trying to scare you!

00:01:40.259 --> 00:01:42.011
The real Frankenstein!

00:01:42.094 --> 00:01:44.096
We know! We love you!

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:45.639
Can you sign my torch?

00:01:47.224 --> 00:01:53.230
Listen, before anything else,
down there's the real Dracula!

00:01:53.314 --> 00:01:54.774
Prove it.

00:01:55.816 --> 00:01:56.901
All right. Continue.

00:01:57.193 --> 00:02:01.030
Drac's daughter's in love,
and he's got to get to the airport!

00:02:01.113 --> 00:02:03.157
And he can't get through this crowd!

00:02:03.407 --> 00:02:06.994
-Why doesn't he fly?
-The sun, you idiot. He's a vampire.

00:02:07.411 --> 00:02:09.747
That's right. Thank you, Monster Nerd.

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:14.710
So, people, if you really are our friends,
clear a path for the man!

00:02:14.835 --> 00:02:18.798
Okay. All Draculas, line up.
Bleh, bleh-bleh.

00:02:22.676 --> 00:02:26.806
Everyone else, lift the capes.
Protect our friend. Bleh, bleh-bleh.

00:02:34.939 --> 00:02:36.857
It's all for you, buddy.

00:02:38.108 --> 00:02:39.777
Go ahead.

00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:41.111
-Good luck!
-Go get 'em!

00:02:41.195 --> 00:02:42.279
Go, Drac, go!

00:02:42.363 --> 00:02:44.198
-Go, Drac!
-Go, Drac!

00:02:44.281 --> 00:02:45.783
Go, Drac!

00:02:47.868 --> 00:02:49.620
Go, Drac!

00:02:52.122 --> 00:02:53.958
Go, Drac!

00:02:54.041 --> 00:02:55.751
Go get 'em!

00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:58.963
Go, Drac, go!

00:02:59.046 --> 00:03:02.424
We love you, Dracula!

00:03:17.147 --> 00:03:18.440
There's no choice.

00:03:58.355 --> 00:04:00.441
Okay. Okay, I must do this.

00:04:18.709 --> 00:04:22.171
Jonathan. Jonathan, can you hear me?

00:04:22.379 --> 00:04:25.382
Tell me, do you dream of being a vampire?

00:04:25.507 --> 00:04:28.552
This is how we're represented. Unbelievable.

00:04:29.053 --> 00:04:30.763
Jonathan. Jonathan.

00:04:31.388 --> 00:04:32.723
Can you hear me?

00:04:32.806 --> 00:04:34.308
Whoa! Bat!

00:04:34.391 --> 00:04:37.227
Wait, it's talking. Dracula? Is that you?

00:04:38.854 --> 00:04:40.022
Dracula.

00:04:40.064 --> 00:04:42.650
I can't understand you.

00:04:42.733 --> 00:04:45.736
What? My hand's in a tan shoe?

00:04:45.819 --> 00:04:49.907
What? Japan's eating lamb stew?

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:51.992
Hey, do you know you're smoking?

00:04:58.999 --> 00:05:00.250
Pardon me. Sorry, excuse me.

00:05:00.334 --> 00:05:02.002
Whoa! Excuse me.

00:05:16.433 --> 00:05:18.852
-What the heck?
-How'd a bat get up this high?

00:05:19.603 --> 00:05:23.774
Folks, I'm gonna turn on the seat belt sign.
Just a precaution while we...

00:05:26.276 --> 00:05:31.031
While we hear a special announcement
for my dear friend Jonathan.

00:05:31.573 --> 00:05:32.574
Dracula?

00:05:32.616 --> 00:05:36.745
My dear boy, I have made a terrible mistake.

00:05:37.037 --> 00:05:43.168
I was trying to keep my baby to myself,
because I knew I would always protect her.

00:05:43.502 --> 00:05:48.841
But I realize now, children
need to discover things for themselves.

00:05:49.049 --> 00:05:52.970
They'll stumble and fall, laugh and cry,

00:05:53.137 --> 00:05:54.972
but such is life.

00:05:55.014 --> 00:05:58.434
The truth is, you and Mavis are meant to be.

00:05:58.475 --> 00:05:59.977
You Zinged.

00:06:00.019 --> 00:06:02.980
If she must give her trust to someone else,

00:06:03.022 --> 00:06:06.150
I'm thankful that it is you, Jonathan.

00:06:06.191 --> 00:06:10.529
I hope you can hear me and forgive me.

00:06:24.376 --> 00:06:29.006
Okay, folks, we're going to make
a quick turnaround to refuel,

00:06:29.131 --> 00:06:31.341
and then we'll be back on our way.

00:06:32.468 --> 00:06:35.137
Quit your whining! I'm burning up out here!

